{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_026_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:15835f3f309baba2e2411341c209098667b1d4c1929d8623106c2c5b5c92d81f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b878c00ad756b88d222d5c4860070b7306ce70a10046cd790419c90f5534df9",
      "text": "给我的情人节巧克力？\n虽然猜到可能会收到……不，没什么。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b61c1d05c12fe011d2a71e2f85a7f4abf5a45091278ecf8b744d611be26173c1",
      "text": "多谢了，●●●●●●●●●●番长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a09cf69132ad228dfdf09ff6ddc25429de30b19c285c9ae7ca3cc92b2ffa481",
      "text": "看起来很好吃的巧克力啊。\n吃了这个，感觉干劲会越来越足了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4549a54265196c98385c077aeb0904034e31f5bec1ea4e090df0c03f4c4d790a",
      "text": "不屈不挠，无论有怎样的困难阻挡在前，\n也绝不会气馁。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5adefc3319c058a0175a6df1a8522376b0df0c6ec66e0b8852a22d7bed2d1af",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●番长，\n今后我和朱雀也一起拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1ebeab5ff711592ddec5b03685c85d294437fee85d4d03536c31e328f64c760",
      "text": "这盒巧克力，是给我的吗？\n……这样啊。多谢了，番长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bdc8e0aa8fd51e80fab0941d74c586c8a2c401119c4e61b8d665e741643080a",
      "text": "嗯？啊，我可不是讨厌巧克力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b73682ec36a19a621d57f03ecffb505b712d4caee92ef65c5d29750b8a796696",
      "text": "只是以前总觉得情人节是个轻佻的节日，\n现在觉得其实挺不错的而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b610e69f1548580617ae85596419e22e37bf8f3ed89fd80a0f21e5af9da5ce5c",
      "text": "话虽如此，这还真是倾注了相当多心力的巧克力啊。\n番长的心意我都感受到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_b:cmd-000038:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0db143120c4b07e2ef72028c816384550b0f67a7a457f76f270bd696617fa3e8",
      "text": "倾注了Passion！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_b:cmd-000039:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:938f744665fd7eb2a836416b642821621c1f57edb4e2bc02d192c75ce1c37a04",
      "text": "倾注了毫不含糊的干劲！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b200b52241cb3708690c028932275a089ddfc638b601e416ad117687543913d",
      "text": "原来如此。吃了这个，感觉偶像活动也能够\n银鳞跃动、势头强劲地开展了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3f0f388e38f393bdac34f93da1076073a16e3d2fba7816d3b1c48fdae84495c",
      "text": "紧裈一番。就留到关键的时刻\n再享用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32f9ecbcfb7acabc247bfa0186e11d1f971759b1e2368e095162b1ca7778c390",
      "text": "再次向你道谢，番长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_22:5_01_026_22_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:196faab518c5e79e5226c2e24de481805e563f2aa803727b56888a981911a8fb",
      "text": "巧克力中所倾注的心意，神速一魂的黑野玄武，\n确实地收下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
